              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;"><span style="color:var(--lcx-slate-400);">Confidence Rating:</span><span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:800;color:var(--lcx-blue-400);">98.4% auto-pass</span></div>
